SOURCE MATERIAL AND ATTRIBUTION
================================================================================

ProForma implements four frameworks taught in the module

    AI Leadership: Commercial value with AI

which forms part of the Proficient AI Engineer program by Ed Donner:

    https://edwarddonner.com/proficient/

The four documents are:

  1. High-Level Strategic Decision Framework
     The five-year cost / benefit / risk model, its seven cost lines, three
     benefit categories and three risk-mitigation lines, and the rule that
     annual amounts begin in the second year.
     Implemented in: src/lib/defaults.ts, src/lib/calc.ts

  2. Cross-Functional AI Project Decision-Making Framework
     The eighteen stakeholder roles, and the architecture decision matrix
     with its seven risk dimensions and named owners.
     Implemented in: src/data/stakeholders.ts, src/data/decisions.ts

  3. End-to-End AI Delivery Roadmap
     Six phase gates by seven swimlanes, 122 deliverables.
     Implemented in: src/data/roadmap.ts

  4. AI Industry Use Cases
     Twenty industries, each with a predictive, generative and agentic
     example.
     Implemented in: src/data/industries.ts

Each of those files carries a header comment naming its source document.


WHAT IS BORROWED AND WHAT IS NOT

The structure and method are Ed Donner's: which cost lines exist, which
benefit categories a case is argued in, which risk dimensions get scored and
by whom, the shape of the delivery roadmap, and the arithmetic convention
that one-time amounts land in Year 1 while annual amounts apply to Years 2-5.
ProForma is faithful to that arithmetic and does not vary it.

The application is classHuman AI's: the interface, the calculation engine,
the token cost model, the export formats, the readiness checks, and all
explanatory and guidance text.

The industry descriptions in src/data/industries.ts were rewritten in
ProForma's own words. The original entries were closer to encyclopedia
summaries; these are framed around the cost and benefit shape a business case
would actually claim. Unsourced performance figures present in the original
were removed rather than repeated. The industry list and the
predictive / generative / agentic structure are retained from the source.

src/data/roadmap.ts, src/data/stakeholders.ts and src/data/decisions.ts
follow their source documents closely. They encode structure and method
rather than prose, and they are attributed here rather than rewritten,
because changing them would change what the framework says.


