BASIS OF USE

Lawrence Jefferson II completed the Proficient AI Engineer program;
certificate issued 3 August 2026. The toolkits were distributed to program
participants, and the accompanying workbooks invite participants to share
improvements back. ProForma is published in that spirit: it is a working
implementation of the method, offered back freely under an open licence,
with the source named throughout.

What ProForma publishes is the method rather than the material. Which cost
lines exist, which categories a case is argued in, which risks get scored and
by whom, and the convention that annual amounts begin in the second year are
a system of analysis, not a piece of writing. The writing in this repository
is ProForma's own -- and where the source's own prose was closest to the
surface, in the industry use-case bank, it was rewritten rather than
reproduced.

